<!--
  The Map Position menu in the headset (sdk/menus.js), from the main menu and the card on the desk. A flat VR menu:
  1 UIKit px is one of Meta's dp (1/16 of a degree) where it stands, 0.64 m away (0.70 mm a px), so the menu is
  415 x 560 px (29 x 39 cm). The site's colors (styles.css) and Jost.

    TITLE      415 x 80, dark brown, "MAP POSITION" in Jost italic, 36 px, cream (the italic is set in sdk/menus.js:
               UIKitML only takes its own font names, and Jost italic is made in sdk/fonts.js).
    TEXT       what the menu does, 15 px Jost in cream, in a red box 375 x 60.
    BUTTONS    Move the Map and Room Setup: 315 x 55, dark brown, 5 px corners, their words 36 px Jost regular in cream.
    SCALE      its label ("Map's Scale", 20 px Jost in a dark brown box 115 x 33) on the step bar: 535 x 55, dark
               brown, 60 px past the menu on both sides, with 10 squares 45 x 45, 6 px apart, one for each of the map's
               10 sizes on a wall. The squares up to the size chosen are the site's yellow, the rest cream (set in code); the first
               has a minus on it and the last a plus. (On a table the map is sized to fit the table: the bar is dimmed
               and doesn't change it, in code.)
    DONE       242 x 65, red with a 5 px dark brown stroke, half over the menu's lower edge, "Done" in 36 px Jost.
  The step bar and Done are drawn over the menu's edge (z-index 1: no more, or a fingertip picks them from further
  away: sdk/panels.js fairTouch).

  CENTERED   UIKit sets a line of Jost a little high in its box (about 0.28 of its size), so each button's words are
             pushed down by half their padding-top to sit in the middle. Their words span the
             whole button, centered, and never break onto a second line (word-break: keep-all: "Room Setup" did).
  TAPPING (sdk/input.js tappable): each button and square is one pressable thing, words and signs included; its
  `press` sits on it (set in sdk/menus.js). Nothing here scrolls. The panel needs the ids page, title and close
  (sdk/panels.js); this menu has no ✕ (Done closes it), so its close is hidden.
-->
<style>
  .panel {
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    width: 415px;
    height: 560px;
    background-color: #F2E8D5;
    border-width: 4px;
    border-color: #24150d;
    border-radius: 6px;
  }
  .bar {
    flex-direction: row;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    width: 415px;
    height: 80px;
    margin-top: -4px;
    background-color: #24150d;
    border-top-left-radius: 6px;
    border-top-right-radius: 6px;
  }
  .title {
    color: #F2E8D5;
    font-size: 36px;
    font-weight: normal;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    padding-top: 20px;
  }
  .close {
    display: none;
  }
  .page {
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    width: 407px;
    height: 476px;
    padding-top: 13px;
  }
  .about {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    width: 375px;
    height: 60px;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding-left: 4px;
    padding-right: 4px;
    background-color: #8C2B22;
    border-radius: 4px;
  }
  .about-text {
    color: #F2E8D5;
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: normal;
    line-height: 125%;
    text-align: center;
    padding-top: 4px;
  }
  .button {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    width: 315px;
    height: 55px;
    margin-top: 30px;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    background-color: #24150d;
    border-radius: 5px;
  }
  .button:hover {
    background-color: #4a3222;
  }
  .button:active {
    background-color: #6b4a36;
  }
  .label {
    color: #F2E8D5;
    font-size: 36px;
    font-weight: normal;
    text-align: center;
    width: 100%;
    word-break: keep-all;
    padding-top: 20px;
  }
  .second {
    margin-top: 38px;
  }
  .scale {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    width: 115px;
    height: 33px;
    margin-top: 38px;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    background-color: #24150d;
  }
  .scale-text {
    color: #F2E8D5;
    font-size: 20px;
    font-weight: normal;
    text-align: center;
    width: 100%;
    word-break: keep-all;
    padding-top: 11px;
  }
  .steps {
    z-index: 1;
    flex-direction: row;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    width: 535px;
    height: 55px;
    gap: 6px;
    background-color: #24150d;
    border-radius: 4px;
  }
  .step {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    width: 45px;
    height: 45px;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    background-color: #F2E8D5;
  }
  .step:hover {
    background-color: #fffaf0;
  }
  .sign {
    width: 26px;
    height: 5px;
    background-color: #24150d;
  }
  .upright {
    position-type: absolute;
    position-left: 20px;
    position-top: 9.5px;
    width: 5px;
    height: 26px;
    background-color: #24150d;
  }
  .done {
    z-index: 1;
    position-type: absolute;
    position-bottom: -32px;
    position-left: 82.5px;
    width: 242px;
    height: 65px;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    background-color: #8C2B22;
    border-width: 5px;
    border-color: #24150d;
    border-radius: 32px;
  }
  .done:hover {
    background-color: #a8382d;
  }
  .done:active {
    background-color: #6e2019;
  }
</style>
<div id="panel" class="panel">
  <div class="bar">
    <span id="title" class="title">MAP POSITION</span>
  </div>
  <div id="page" class="page">
    <div class="about"><span id="about" class="about-text">You can change the size or arrange your setup, or reposition the map on a wall or table around your place.</span></div>
    <div id="move" class="button"><span id="move-label" class="label">Move the Map</span></div>
    <div id="setup" class="button second"><span id="setup-label" class="label">Room Setup</span></div>
    <div class="scale"><span id="scale-label" class="scale-text">Map's Scale</span></div>
    <div id="steps" class="steps">
      <div id="s0" class="step"><div class="sign"></div></div>
      <div id="s1" class="step"></div>
      <div id="s2" class="step"></div>
      <div id="s3" class="step"></div>
      <div id="s4" class="step"></div>
      <div id="s5" class="step"></div>
      <div id="s6" class="step"></div>
      <div id="s7" class="step"></div>
      <div id="s8" class="step"></div>
      <div id="s9" class="step"><div class="sign"></div><div class="upright"></div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div id="done" class="done"><span id="done-label" class="label">Done</span></div>
  <div id="close" class="close"></div>
</div>
